# The Waypoints shot: the places the mesh has shared, and how far away each one is.
#
# The right-hand column is the whole reason this tab exists before a map does. A waypoint is a
# name and a point, and what a handheld can say about a point without drawing one is how far
# away it is and which way it lies - so the list answers that, from our own radio's fix, and is
# ordered by it. Three places at three scales, so the shot shows metres and kilometres and more
# than one compass point rather than one range repeated.
#
# The places are put at nodes already in the demo roster, so the ranges are measured between two
# real fixes rather than between two numbers typed to agree.
#
# `clock` is what makes this file a screenshot rather than a picture of when it was taken: the
# ages below come from it, so re-rendering next month produces the same bytes and `git status`
# stays quiet unless the UI actually moved.
scene demo
scale 4
clock 2026-01-12 19:12
config
waypoint FXTR Trailhead | park on the verge, the gate is unlocked
waypoint ALFA Ridge repeater
waypoint CHRL Water cache
tab waypoints
